<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card">{{error}}<button bindtap="retry">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{accessMessage}}" class="card">{{accessMessage}}<button data-url="/pages/account/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/edit.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>账号与身份</text></button></view><view class="card"><view class="title"><image class="section-symbol" src="/images/ui/member.svg"/>全局会员套餐池</view><view>活动奖励与会员购买共享套餐。已发放权益保留领取时的套餐快照。</view><button wx:if="{{canHQ}}" data-url="/pages/config-editor/index?kind=plan" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/sun.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>新增套餐</text></button></view><view wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="title">{{item.name}}</view><view>{{item.days}}天 · 每日{{item.dailyLimit}}次 · ¥{{item.price}}</view><view>{{item.enabled?'已上架':'已下架'}} · 修订 {{item.revision}}</view><view>{{item.features}}</view><view>每人累计限领 {{item.perUserLimit||10}} 次</view><button data-url="/pages/config-editor/index?kind=plan&id={{item.id}}" bindtap="go">{{canHQ?'编辑套餐':'查看套餐'}}</button><button wx:if="{{canHQ}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggle">上架 / 下架</button></view></view>